OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start but cloud soon
OL,6,Fincreasing from the west bringing
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain to most places by
OL,8,Fmidday. The rain becoming occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy in the afternoon. Strengthening
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with further rain at
OL,13,Ftimes this evening and into the night
OL,14,Fsome heavy at times. Becoming drier
OL,15,Flater in the night in north, west with
OL,16,Fa few clear intervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
