OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAny lingering rain in
OL,6,Fsoutheast soon clearing then a day of
OL,7,Fsunny intervals and blustery showers
OL,8,Fthese heavier and more frequent in the
OL,9,Fwest. Windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells and blustery heavy showers on
OL,13,FSaturday, the showers easing later.
OL,14,FMostly dry and bright Sunday, then
OL,15,Fcloudy with some rain on Monday
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
